<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>C++ Developer Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --accent: #38bdf8;
            --accent-hover: #0ea5e9;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            padding: 4rem 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .subtitle { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.25rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .highlight { color: var(--accent); }

        /* Grid */
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        /* Cards */
        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }

        .card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--accent); }
        .card p { color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

        .tech-stack {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .tag {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .status-dot {
            height: 10px;
            width: 10px;
            background-color: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>Hello, I'm <span class="highlight">Dev</span>.</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">I build high-performance systems using Modern C++ and Drogon. I focus on latency, memory safety, and clean architecture.</p>
        </header>

        <section>
            <div class="grid">
                <!-- Project 1 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>High-Freq Engine</h3>
                    <p>A matching engine for order books capable of processing 50k messages per second.</p>
                    <div class="tech-stack">
                        <span class="tag">C++20</span>
                        <span class="tag">Lock-free</span>
                        <span class="tag">Linux</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Project 2 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Drogon Web Server</h3>
                    <p>You are looking at it! A custom portfolio website served entirely by a C++ backend.</p>
                    <div class="tech-stack">
                        <span class="tag">Drogon</span>
                        <span class="tag">CMake</span>
                        <span class="tag">HTML5</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Project 3 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Game Networking</h3>
                    <p>UDP-based reliable transport protocol for multiplayer game state synchronization.</p>
                    <div class="tech-stack">
                        <span class="tag">C++17</span>
                        <span class="tag">Sockets</span>
                        <span class="tag">ASIO</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p><span class="status-dot"></span>System Online &bull; Served by C++</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>